  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      366.07,
      455.9,
      413.54
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 7 of the Defence Services Command and StaffCollege Act, No. 5 of 2008 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and thelegal effect of the section as amended is to include the Vice-Chancellor of the GeneralSir John Kotelawala Defence University in the Board of Management of the Staff Collegeinstead of the Vice-Chancellor of the University of Kelaniya.",
