      161.85,
      454.97,
      401.88,
      502.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 15 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (1) of that section by the repeal ofparagraph (b) of that subsection and the substitution therefor,of the following paragraph:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
